      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "98a80527ec2119d4c451b572386ff034f5825623e8460c704ed68820a545ad0d",
      "text": "Spend a week seeing three sides of Brazil. Start in Rio de Janeiro with Corcovado, Christ the Redeemer, Sugarloaf Mountain and the historic city centre. Then head to the Green Coast for the islands and beaches of Angra dos Reis, a boat trip around the bay and a transfer to historic Paraty. The last few days take you through the Atlantic Forest, past waterfalls and old distilleries, and into the coves of Saco de Mamanguá.",
